          "title": "You'll want to know: મંડપ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મંડપ — manḍap — \"a pavilion (for a festival)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચોકમાં મોટો મંડપ હતો. cokmā̃ moṭo manḍap hato. There was a big pavilion in the square."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મંડપ (manḍap) is a tatsama, Sanskrit maṇḍapa, \"an open temporary shed, a pavilion\" (CDIAL 9740). It is put up for weddings and festivals."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
